@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ Bug fixes
 New features
 ------------
 
+* Arrays and object maps can now be destructured in `let` and `const` statements, e.g. `let [a, b] = array;` and `let #{ x, y } = map;` ([`#684`](https://github.com/rhaiscript/rhai/issues/684)).
 * New `no_ast` feature that excludes the `AST`, its interpreter, the tokenizer, parser and optimizer for a minimized build.  Under this feature flag, the Rhai Grain VM is the only venue to evaluate a script.
 
 Enhancements
